  "nodes": [
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h8",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Rockchip Pinctrl Probe 流程分析\n核心：RK3568 引脚控制初始化\n文件：pinctrl-rockchip.c",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -225,
      "y": -900
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "c3d4e5f6g7h8i9j0",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "rockchip_pinctrl 结构体\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-rockchip.h\n作用：厂商特定封装 (含硬件资源)\n\n扩展字段:\n• regmap_base - GRF 寄存器映射\n• regmap_pull - Pull 寄存器映射\n• regmap_pmu - PMU 寄存器映射\n• ctrl - SoC 特定数据指针\n• pctl - 嵌入的 pinctrl_desc\n• groups/functions - 引脚组/功能表",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -225,
      "y": -550
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "b2c3d4e5f6g7h8i9",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_desc 结构体\n路径：include/linux/pinctrl/pinctrl.h\n作用：通用引脚控制器描述\n\n关键成员:\n• name - 控制器名称\n• pins - 引脚描述数组\n• npins - 引脚总数\n• pctlops - 控制操作集\n• pmxops - 复用操作集\n• confops - 配置操作集",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": 380,
      "y": -550
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 450,
      "id": "d4e5f6g7h8i9j0k1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "rockchip_pinctrl_probe\n入口：平台驱动探针函数\n\n执行流程:\n1. 检查 DT - 验证 of_node\n2. 分配内存 - devm_kzalloc(info)\n3. 获取 SoC 数据 - rockchip_pinctrl_get_soc_data\n4. 映射寄存器:\n   • 解析 rockchip,grf (Syscon/MMIO)\n   • 解析 rockchip,pmu (可选)\n5. SoC 初始化 - ctrl->soc_data_init\n6. 注册 Pinctrl - rockchip_pinctrl_register\n7. 注册 GPIO - of_platform_populate",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -820,
      "y": -550
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 350,
      "id": "e5f6g7h8i9j0k1l2",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "rockchip_pinctrl_register\n作用：填充描述符并注册子系统\n\n关键步骤:\n1. 初始化 pinctrl_desc:\n   • 设置 name, owner\n   • 绑定 ops (pctlops, pmxops, confops)\n2. 生成引脚描述:\n   • 遍历 Banks/Pins\n   • 动态命名 (如\"gpio0-0\")\n3. 解析 DT: rockchip_pinctrl_parse_dt\n4. 最终注册：devm_pinctrl_register",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -160,
      "y": -80
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 300,
      "id": "f6g7h8i9j0k1l2m3",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "devm_pinctrl_register\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.c\n特性：设备资源管理 (自动释放)\n\n内部逻辑:\n1. devres_alloc - 分配释放回调\n2. pinctrl_register - 执行核心注册\n3. devres_add - 加入资源链表\n\n意义：确保设备卸载时自动清理",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -160,
      "y": 320
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 250,
      "id": "j0k1l2m3n4o5p6q7",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_register (核心)\n最终动作:\n\n1. pinctrl_init_controller:\n   • 初始化内部结构\n   • 建立引脚映射\n2. pinctrl_enable:\n   • 激活控制器\n   • 应用默认配置",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -160,
      "y": 650
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "k1l2m3n4o5p6q7r8",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "关键连接点\n通过 pinctrl_register 函数，将静态的 pinctrl_desc 初始化为运行时的 pinctrl_dev，并建立内部索引树。",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -160,
      "y": 950
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 300,
      "id": "g7h8i9j0k1l2m3n4",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_ops\n通用控制接口\n\n• get_groups_count - 获取组数\n• get_group_name - 获取组名\n• get_group_pins - 获取组内引脚\n• dt_node_to_map - DT 转 Map\n• dt_free_map - 释放 Map",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -1340,
      "y": -30
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 300,
      "id": "h8i9j0k1l2m3n4o5",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinmux_ops\n引脚复用接口\n\n• request/free - 申请/释放\n• get_functions_count - 获取功能数\n• set_mux - 设置复用功能\n• gpio_request_enable - GPIO 使能\n• gpio_set_direction - 设置方向",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -1340,
      "y": 350
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 300,
      "id": "i9j0k1l2m3n4o5p6",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinconf_ops\n电气配置接口\n\n• pin_config_get/set - 单个引脚配置\n• pin_config_group_get/set - 引脚组配置\n• is_generic - 是否通用配置\n• *_dbg_show - 调试信息显示",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 450,
      "x": -1340,
      "y": 750
    }
  ]
}